      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸自不必说，\n此外还有里见皇冠，以及称之为\n当代最强赛马娘都不为过的北部玄驹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65c1b6007e5470875ad783e832bd7dcebfbf07ebf8186f6e31948a084d286339",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
