    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2cccc7f62b003fc0c7b646e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强击对此并不害怕，反而很期待。\n为了成为第一，为了在迪拜取胜，\n强击面对夏季集训充满了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82210358d74c6e570d575b930b9437bbf4ae20bbac7f7675c2dabb3ab3ab2646",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc7014138edb3bec6407d8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第3年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2018daecd587b3acd573214a2b2c9e4607f1262610f0ce7cb9324e673d98a91d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad8c63e66c8cffce8ad5a03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在前往出道战场地的路途中，\n强击收到了来自母亲和姐姐的\n粉丝们的热情声援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f77b0efb8e2ae01c31ae0fdb451af5543369e7aa42de99bbba193d94b4b0b814",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9090ede62a8e30269bd01d0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然做出了要和姐姐走同一条道路的声明，\n自然就会产生对于三后冠的高期待。\n也不知道到时她会不会感到压力重大――",
      "source_fingerprint": "be602ce24f05c9fbb6019577a28761b7dea3c2780eaf9d96b2cfa28bdc8969b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c3e296f48c410683032e41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强击并未顾虑这种事，\n开朗乐观地参加了出道战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "987ba69585408d4ce1e2f0bea726fbb40aab3c03689a3bd81d199e252737cea1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02dfa2a7d91d72ad099d0302",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎接出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "018ebc76f91e1364fda1e682037fe6e068f560f98ca82032cd4a7940f5bd0cab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091410.json",
