    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33060c45795a5efa761798f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前——\n强击的身体看起来没什么大的问题，\n接下来只要在赛场上好好加油就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab816cf39eefc3b714fa23230eef5586200a2f0ec050fbc028f0f88f1b15067",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
