      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然是2400米的长距离比赛，\n但强击还是和往常一样\n开朗活泼地参加了比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "519a9fa71b36f24dd8156b7cb31abedf996547af24ab5b0b31940032c52413cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
