      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说『紫苑锦标』跑得好的赛马娘，\n大多也会活跃在『秋华赏』的赛场上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8042d056b22489844f67653d8e38fe4f32dc7884cb1ed1901488db4f1190633",
