      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过夏季集训后，向着最后一冠出发，\n为了确认自己现在的实力，\n强击将要挑战『紫苑锦标』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d18aee600127c707c4c45afa02ad86f6cfbdbaee4b9a6506eb48715b8f3cfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
