    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050ab1553487734c0a574240",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道时几乎都是母亲和姐姐的粉丝，\n而现在都是为她应援的声音。\n强击的家人也赶来为她加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4c95485e7a466d0696009fd927b732a340d52bd3cbe38b968f6b95ea2a9f58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
